 locals, share their joys and troubles, and lend a helping hand whenever you can.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, cooking, deliveries, part-time jobs, sneaking in a little break... Even the messiest days can become wonderful memories when you follow the beat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turns out, everyday life has a rhythm of its own.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Rhythm Animal Cafe<\/i>, a heartwarming and hilarious collection of rhythm mini-games!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/14f4129a9461a0745dd966e35631e382.poster.avif?t=1792207658\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/14f4129a9461a0745dd966e35631e382.webm?t=1792207658\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/14f4129a9461a0745dd966e35631e382.mp4?t=1792207658\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 Feel the Beat, Even Without Watching the Screen!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever find yourself tapping along to your favorite song without thinking?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's the idea behind <i>Rhythm Animal Cafe<\/i>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to the beat. Press the button. That's it!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated button combinations or endless streams of notes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just follow the rhythm, and you'll quickly get the hang of it, even if you've never played a rhythm game before.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every beat, melody, and character animation is carefully designed to let you rely on your ears as much as your eyes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hitting every beat perfectly? That's another story!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/961a170d0f259a9433075c2ba6ca2dc1.poster.avif?t=1792207658\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/961a170d0f259a9433075c2ba6ca2dc1.webm?t=1792207658\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/961a170d0f259a9433075c2ba6ca2dc1.mp4?t=1792207658\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 Everyday Life, Extraordinary Rhythm Challenges!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal in town has a job, a story, and a rhythm of their own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An office worker struggling with his boss's empty promises, a panda cooking up a storm, and residents juggling one part-time job after another...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ordinary moments become a colorful collection of rhythm mini-games, each with its own music and surprises.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the beat for a satisfying performance, or miss a few notes and enjoy the animals' hilarious reactions!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After all, a Perfect isn't always the funniest outcome!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/a4a29cfbdaf6e8c7516b8096b0ed81b1.poster.avif?t=1792207658\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/a4a29cfbdaf6e8c7516b8096b0ed81b1.webm?t=1792207658\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/a4a29cfbdaf6e8c7516b8096b0ed81b1.mp4?t=1792207658\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎶 35 Tracks That Bring Everyday Sounds to Life<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clattering dishes, bustling street stalls, neighbors chatting...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, even the sounds of everyday life become part of the music!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>35 tracks<\/strong> across a variety of styles, including Jazz, Pop, and House, the soundtrack brings every scene to life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music, gameplay, and animation work together to make you feel like you're part of the animals' everyday adventures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some tunes are sweet and relaxing. Others are so catchy they'll stick in your head all day!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be surprised if you find yourself tapping along long after you've stopped playing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/dc11f6deacdf0453d9ebc44470bb17e2.avif?t=1792207658\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras_big\/dc11f6deacdf0453d9ebc44470bb17e2.avif?t=1792207658 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 A Cozy, Hand-Drawn World Full of Life<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm sunlight, leafy rooftops, a vintage record player, and a whole town of busy, fluffy residents.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its lively 2D hand-drawn animation, <i>Rhythm Animal Cafe<\/i> feels like a storybook brought to life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no world to save and no evil overlord to defeat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just work, meals, friends, everyday worries, and that wonderful moment when you can finally relax after a long day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's these little moments that make up the rhythm of life.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/39e7028bfa2032572a1f4dd746e72f48.avif?t=1792207658\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras_big\/39e7028bfa2032572a1f4dd746e72f48.webp?t=1792207658 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Create Your Own Rhythm!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of this little town is far from over!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Level Editor<\/strong> is planned for a future update, giving Managers the chance to create rhythm mini-games of their own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own challenges, combine music, sound effects, animations, and performances, and even tell your own stories!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We can't wait to see the creativity our community brings to this world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Level Editor is currently in development. Its release date will be announced later.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras\/c7c341f7e4e2b63954f48669ad73ece2.avif?t=1792207658\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/extras_big\/c7c341f7e4e2b63954f48669ad73ece2.avif?t=1792207658 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☕ Managers, Welcome to the Cafe!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life can get busy, and things don't always go as planned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with a little music, there's always a bit of happiness to be found.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're feeling tired, why not stop by our little cafe and stay a while?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The coffee's ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All we're missing is you, Manager! ☕🎵<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Rhythm Animal Cafe is a hilarious, heartwarming collection of hand-drawn rhythm mini-games! Enjoy 35 tracks, creative challenges, and quirky animal stories. With varied gameplay, charming characters, and plenty of laughs, even your mistakes will make you smile!","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/658591f2caebe2e214ac7b66c4c1e0fbe18101aa\/header.jpg?t=1792207658","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/028a19009f8c77c18c2968181ecf69ac3c7a003f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792207658","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3859210\/028a19009f8c77c18c2968181ecf69ac3c7a003f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792207658","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo @ 2.00 GHz or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel® HD Graphics or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10, or Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo @ 2.00 GHz or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX750<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requireme